; The `example` zone of the test resolver (ticket 032, story 007).
;
; Docker seeds the `resolver-zones` volume from this file the first time it is
; created. Story 007 rewrites the copy in the volume with the identity ids the
; run minted, and CoreDNS rereads it within five seconds:
;
;   docker compose ... exec -T resolver \
;     sh -c 'cat > /etc/coredns/zones/example.zone' < the-new-zone
;
; A hostname claim is `_mabel.<hostname> IN TXT "mabel=<identity id>"`
; (proposal 003 section 2). Beside it, `mabel-endpoints=<id>,<id>` names the
; machines that answer for whatever identity the same label claims (proposal
; 006 section 6). The serial has to rise on every rewrite, or the `file` plugin
; keeps serving what it already loaded.

$ORIGIN example.
$TTL 5

@   IN SOA ns.example. hostmaster.example. (
        1          ; serial, raise it on every rewrite
        60         ; refresh
        30         ; retry
        300        ; expire
        5 )        ; negative caching TTL
@   IN NS  ns.example.
ns  IN A   127.0.0.1

; What the container's healthcheck asks for. Story 007 keeps this record when
; it rewrites the zone, or the resolver goes unhealthy.
_mabel.health IN TXT "mabel=health"

; A label naming five machines. A TXT character-string holds 255 bytes and
; `mabel-endpoints=` plus four ids is 227, so five have to be split across two
; character-strings in one record; a reader joins them back with no separator
; before it parses anything (proposal 006 section 6). The first string ends with
; the comma after the fourth id, so the fifth is only there once the two are
; joined and neither half names all five on its own.
;
; The five ids are ed25519 public keys generated from fixed seeds and no machine
; answers at any of them: what this label proves is the parsing rule, which
; costs no container. Story 007 keeps this record when it rewrites the zone.
_mabel.many-machines IN TXT "mabel=xpezo4a4wovzgs7dx43f2pzwk2w7gutnvrzmsrgzuxtcfzjbw4ka"
_mabel.many-machines IN TXT "mabel-endpoints=cmo62aqzrfceqo7ruqkrvzutvktcw6474cwkovxd7z7ctorce3na,xyhbzzscrer36lffdqwwmhuqv45sshxx7wgfoxvlvj2suhub427a,72al4if4g2w4hrpec4r66oz3gs6xypgvk6avk73uduy6ffkrceva,msccj64kqyg7wqltmbwoom5kdimw7jzyb7yply2a7lnvvsxttvka," "hyzbxuqfwf3yq2lnc7a5civnjlrgfigue7p6itgy2on4bpnnxsgq"
